<title>USA: Times Mirror 4-week ad revs up 4.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Times Mirror 4-week ad revs up 4.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Times Mirror Co said Thursday that its advertising revenues for its newspaper publishing group in the four-week period ending June 29 increased by 4.9 percent to $127.89 million.</p>
<p>In the same period in the prior year, ad revenues were $121.95 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
